{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01228","headline":"相和歌辞 相逢行 · 韦应物","name":"相和歌辞 相逢行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十登汉朝，英声迈今古。\n适从东方来，又欲谒明主。\n犹酣新丰酒，尚带霸陵雨。\n邂逅两相逢，别来间寒暑。\n宁知白日晚，暂向花间语。\n忽闻长乐钟，走马东西去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}